ues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"House prices increase every year, so there is a need for a system to predict house prices in the future. House price prediction can help the developer determine the selling price of a house and can help the customer to arrange the right time to purchase a house. There are three factors that influence the price of a house which include physical conditions, concept and location. This project aims to predict house prices. Proudly created by Harsh Nagoriya","topics":[],"score":2237,"global_rank":208178},{"name":"harshnagoriya/Iris-flowers-classification","owner":"harshnagoriya","html_url":"https://github.com/harshnagoriya/Iris-flowers-classification","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"The aim of this project is to classify iris flowers among three species (setosa, versicolor or virginica) from measurements of length and width of sepals and petals.","topics":[],"score":2237,"global_rank":208179},{"name":"yyexela/EE577_Project","owner":"yyexela","html_url":"https://github.com/yyexela/EE577_Project","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":null,"topics":[],"score":2237,"global_rank":208181}]